sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor P as Pembeli
  participant R as Rasa Core
  participant N as NLU service
  participant V as validate_order_status_form
  participant A as action_check_order_status
  participant S as api-service (Node)
  participant D as MySQL MAMP
  P->>R: "What is the status of my order?"
  R->>N: POST /model/parse
  N-->>R: intent check_order_status (0.97), entities []
  R->>R: RulePolicy: aktifkan order_status_form
  R-->>P: utter_ask_order_id
  P->>R: "nomornya 123"
  R->>N: POST /model/parse
  N-->>R: intent provide_order_id, entities []
  R->>V: from_text "nomornya 123"
  V-->>R: order_id = None + utter_invalid_order_id
  R-->>P: "Nomor pesanan terdiri dari 5 digit..."
  P->>R: "#35;10003"
  R->>N: POST /model/parse
  N-->>R: provide_order_id, entity order_id=10003
  R->>V: validate_order_id("10003") OK
  R-->>P: utter_ask_customer_email
  P->>R: "sophia.brown@x.dummyjson.com"
  R->>N: POST /model/parse
  N-->>R: provide_email, entity email
  R->>V: validate_customer_email OK
  R->>R: form selesai (requested_slot = null)
  R->>A: jalankan custom action
  A->>S: GET /api/orders/10003?email=...
  S->>D: SELECT order JOIN customers + items
  D-->>S: baris pesanan
  S->>S: cek email = pemilik? (404 seragam bila tidak)
  S-->>A: 200 JSON status, kurir, resi, item
  A-->>R: utter_message(teks) + SlotSet(order_id, None)
  R-->>P: "Pesanan #35;10003 a.n. Sophia Brown, Status: Dalam pengiriman..."
